OL,3,AGTA 6 leaks - a nightmare or a blip for
OL,4,Athe biggest video game of the year?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's been more than 18 months since the
OL,7,Flast trailer for Grand Theft Auto 6 was
OL,8,Freleased.
OL,10,FA few weeks ago, developer Rockstar
OL,11,Fannounced it would break its long
OL,12,Fsilence with a special "extended look"
OL,13,Fat the highly anticipated video game in
OL,14,Fa Netflix special.
OL,16,FBut the run-up to the splashy preview
OL,17,Fhas been potentially overshadowed by a
OL,18,Fstring of apparent leaks which appear
OL,19,Fto show footage of GTA 6 in action.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
